WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:10.860
In tutorial 9.3, you'll add the links
Google has seen to your link list.

00:00:12.185 --> 00:00:15.870
First, open Backlinks, and scroll
to Where your links come from.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:18.144
Then click Add Search Console links.

00:00:19.689 --> 00:00:22.454
Next, get the file from
your Search Console.

00:00:22.504 --> 00:00:26.118
Click Walk me through the export,
and a guide shows you each step.

00:00:27.164 --> 00:00:31.189
In Search Console, open Links,
export the latest external links,

00:00:31.239 --> 00:00:35.112
and download the file. Click
Done, next step as you go.

00:00:36.111 --> 00:00:40.291
Now close the guide. Back in the
upload window, click Choose File,

00:00:40.341 --> 00:00:42.181
and pick the file you downloaded.

00:00:43.586 --> 00:00:48.414
Then click Upload. When you upload again
later, the new file replaces the old one.

00:00:51.065 --> 00:00:54.490
Your sources then show the rows
and the date of your upload,

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:58.133
and the next full backlink check
adds those links to your list.

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:03.367
Search Console shares only a sample
of your links, and it changes.

00:01:03.417 --> 00:01:05.673
So repeat the export every few months.

00:01:06.692 --> 00:01:10.667
Alaventra also checks that the
file lists links to your website.

00:01:10.717 --> 00:01:15.442
If it's another site's file, Check this
first tells you before anything is loaded.

00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:17.938
Click Cancel, and choose your own file.

00:01:18.946 --> 00:01:23.831
So, open Add Search Console links,
export the file from Search Console,

00:01:23.881 --> 00:01:27.585
choose it and upload it, and
cancel a file for another website.

00:01:28.598 --> 00:01:33.504
Next, connect the mailbox your
pitches go out from, in tutorial 9.4.
